{
  "about": "Every configurable subsystem the spec names, with the Better options that cover it. A subsystem with none is listed as not yet covered in the app's metrics reference, so gaps are visible, not silent (spec: Configuration review, 'Better options'). 'also' lists the findings that check a subsystem besides its options; 'phase' says when a subsystem's own analysis comes, for one the app does not cover yet.",
  "texts": {
    "question_action": {
      "en": "Answer it in the platform setup ({field}): the app then tells you which better options this aircraft can use.",
      "uk": "Дайте відповідь у налаштуванні платформи ({field}): тоді застосунок скаже, які кращі варіанти доступні цьому апарату."
    },
    "needs": {
      "en": "needs",
      "uk": "потрібно"
    }
  },
